# Electroduplicate (CR 707.2, 707.9a, 603.2): Bot1 casts Mons's Goblin Raiders (1/1) and then Electroduplicate targeting it. The
# token copy has haste, so it attacks the turn it is made and Bot2 takes 1; it is sacrificed at the beginning of the end step by
# the ability the copy's exception gives it. The Raiders stay and Electroduplicate is in the graveyard.
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus x3
Mons's Goblin Raiders
Electroduplicate
Mountain x2
Mountain x10
[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Mons's Goblin Raiders.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Electroduplicate.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mons's Goblin Raiders)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mons's Goblin Raiders#2.Token = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mons's Goblin Raiders#2.Keywords = Haste
! Bot1.Attack(Mons's Goblin Raiders#1 > Bot2)
Bot1.Attack(Mons's Goblin Raiders#2 > Bot2)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 19
[T2 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Battlefield = Mons's Goblin Raiders
Bot1.Graveyard = Electroduplicate; Black Lotus; Black Lotus; Black Lotus
